{"title":"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On the planet Cemtece, each Cemtece-day has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> Cemtece-hours, and each Cemtece-hour has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> Earth-minutes. How many Cemtece-days does one Earth-day have?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/f/c0ff31b05e3c050fde5ed5a144e14088acf2bb63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60 \\times 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" /> Earth-minutes in an Earth-day. Since each Cemtece-hour is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> Earth-minutes, this means that one Earth-day would have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/3/1b321d0a8725d57f305d65e3924646c0cb6875be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{60 \\times 24}{15} = 4 \\times 24 = 96$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"181\" height=\"38\" /> Cemtece-hour. Each Cemtece-day has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> Cemtece-hours, so one Earth-day would have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/2/382e61d0f6523252672773e12201c8d2fcc5a52e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{96}{16} = \\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"69\" height=\"38\" /> Cemtece-days.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC\">2026 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 2\">Individual Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_4\" title=\"2026 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 4\">Individual Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/